*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv*/
*.db

# Crop recommendation model + dataset ARE committed (small, keeps the app
# functional out of the box). Only the optional trained CNN + raw image
# dataset are excluded, since those require a multi-GB PlantVillage-style
# download the repo intentionally doesn't ship (see cv/scripts/train_disease_model.py).
cv/models/*.h5
cv/models/class_indices.json
datasets/plantvillage/

